The component maps in this folder (hpc.json, lpc.json, fan.json, hpt.json, lpt.json) are the
high-bypass turbofan example maps from NASA's NPSS, as distributed with pyCycle
(https://github.com/OpenMDAO/pyCycle, package om-pycycle 4.4.0, pycycle/maps/). They were converted
to JSON by tools/extract_npss_maps.py; the numbers are unchanged. They are representative public
maps, not the maps of any Siemens Energy or Rolls-Royce engine.

